From: Ubuntu Embedded Team <builder@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] rk3576: disable unused JR3576 ADC download key

Match the JR3576 kernel DTS adc-keys status. Pre-relocation key devices
otherwise survive the early kernel DTB switch and force Rockusb mode.
The UART ctrl+d download hotkey remains available.

--- a/arch/arm/dts/myd-jr3576.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/myd-jr3576.dts
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@
 		io-channel-names = "buttons";
 		keyup-threshold-microvolt = <1800000>;
 		u-boot,dm-pre-reloc;
-		status = "okay";
+		status = "disabled";
 
 		volumeup-key {
 			u-boot,dm-pre-reloc;
